    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797830/extras/52d84c5a482978e3507b1fbf91c7a556.avif?t=1755644651\" width=1280 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Egglings\u00a0</strong>is a beautifully hand-crafted pixel-art creature collector. From birds and amphibians to dinosaurs and dragons, each egg holds a surprise waiting to hatch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your collection as you discover and nurture a wide range of unique creatures. Place your hatched companions - <i>called egglings</i> <i>-\u00a0</i>in the shelter to earn valuable bonuses, or release them into the wild to unlock new rewards. Rare golden variants await the most dedicated collectors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short and satisfying</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock 42 unique creatures</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt for golden egglings</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect, sell, shelter or release</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seven distinct egg types</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797830/extras/051d58967343c63414aa83dddb90d8c7.poster.avif?t=1755644651\" width=250 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797830/extras/051d58967343c63414aa83dddb90d8c7.webm?t=1755644651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797830/extras/52d84c5a482978e3507b1fbf91c7a556.avif?t=1755644651\" width=1280 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Egglings\u00a0</strong>is a beautifully hand-crafted pixel-art creature collector. From birds and amphibians to dinosaurs and dragons, each egg holds a surprise waiting to hatch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your collection as you discover and nurture a wide range of unique creatures. Place your hatched companions - <i>called egglings</i> <i>-\u00a0</i>in the shelter to earn valuable bonuses, or release them into the wild to unlock new rewards. Rare golden variants await the most dedicated collectors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short and satisfying</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock 42 unique creatures</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt for golden egglings</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect, sell, shelter or release</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seven distinct egg types</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797830/extras/051d58967343c63414aa83dddb90d8c7.poster.avif?t=1755644651\" width=250 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797830/extras/051d58967343c63414aa83dddb90d8c7.webm?t=1755644651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
